WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:16.000
[Dutch narration] Police unload paintings from a truck outside the courthouse in Amsterdam.

00:16.000 --> 00:34.000
Men carry the framed paintings up the steps and into the building.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
Han van Meegeren, in a hat and glasses, walks past the camera.

00:40.000 --> 01:20.000
The fake Vermeers on display: close views of a painted jug and the faces in his Supper at Emmaus, then the paintings hanging in the courtroom.

01:20.000 --> 01:32.000
Van Meegeren walks through Amsterdam and enters the court.

01:32.000 --> 01:59.000
Inside the courtroom, judges in robes and a packed public gallery hear the case.
